      "Valorant's accuracy is tied to your movement speed: full running accuracy is very poor.",
      "Tap the opposite movement key briefly before firing (e.g. tap A while holding D) to cancel your momentum almost instantly and shoot while fully stationary -- this is 'counter-strafing'.",
      "Practice the counter-strafe timing in the Range or an Aim Lab-style trainer until stopping to shoot is automatic; peeking while still moving is the single biggest cause of losing gunfights you should win."
